data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2424,"response":{"id":"resp_05ead64b871aca2a016adb5fa7c1d08191ba7de293c3ffdb5d","object":"response","created_at":1792761768,"completed_at":1792761788,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through structured submit_draft (preferred) or the compatible submit_artifact wrapper. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_05ead64b871aca2a016adb5fa9e5508191938700db4fdfe028","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq21-pZ6LGQ5KJX0hBIlxzQ3cf6vJ-Cij3ayhkKaD7gbTBU5HM-2GGlqpvYr2GPGn6E2oE-l2AJAmnMOs89oZ3le-YMwozuFjzx54m5_r05CDIMb9mtwe7c7pAbimgoeE3cXHDEIGgkYRE8q50polgmCWWm9aDZiv0N4CiO9zs7kIlDOrSvkf-zhxix6IRBwB2izyCU9n050q7OBKVuJRGf4cWESqJsvm9j8y_JvSC7dd4Kq6q5pQP6xx6ms2-dIKgq9IqPAzWU6-hs1JzWcJiQRdF-s5ewFQH2-7ywuJl4VReBnh8y-LNXQRp97IllwDOGAEualDCNO8KxaObKPonpqVx-vm30S5_ygksaJuZSNatW2roEqapHKv5GPEzIiJ017nSeA_ubNnu9wZiobK6sJGcHWH-ZOai4t7RssFQBwiF5WG-tsoZdKqP6q96S-unYQcpbSzntFAgpnKp4gnvOLv6oSPjzdOcVxKcIKekAZ8N5ojbIWKe0FqoY4aJLQJ-ndYHKkJi-CedmtCPymKX903WTaO99_p9z08jRdXZ_svEjPrjGs2kCBMcwJ5H_TC5u2t6i-HeOKsJJGqqKmgHZBNTLpDSr3Gp0GJMV7Cws6dEsYZiZ9uDN66_Ei2YV-B4xGRGoqXArolEZgXU3eLeYvpa9rHx7B9OEJ_CWOJjg4JaLA4k_6FJMYNGjGc5bxIqZ1jgWczl5vjf6FFJWloN092bbrMqUWO_1SFI_nS0lFOuwaPct6tFfkgeymBCwIfmm_zcQo_4BUKFs51SMujeEwKCkfAuvVQS1JGnE-fYIyjnnF2eravnuoFQNHl0UWFYgFPNmYmLOcDkh1IT-ta0S6b5HPdEsG9ZKAGNYY8LX_6WM6lXarEYQq3M-aCVu1uLSuQfUyQn2cPqk1wfddaIzdTLdOKgQMdHwdqW5pZzhvUjIhNX6eJivNVfbj5MTX3rF_Gpo7HS_SU5ims62-YdhxqZViQGl